        "content": "import pytest\nfrom agent.graph import validate\n\npytestmark = pytest.mark.xfail(raises=NotImplementedError, reason=\"Phase 3, not yet implemented\")\n\ndef test_proposed_value_equal_to_value_a_is_valid():\n    assert validate(\"ACC-1\", value_a=\"ACC-1\", value_b=\"ACC-2\") is True\n\ndef test_proposed_value_equal_to_value_b_is_valid():\n    assert validate(\"ACC-2\", value_a=\"ACC-1\", value_b=\"ACC-2\") is True\n\ndef test_normalized_form_of_an_observed_value_is_valid():\n    assert validate(\"ACME INC\", value_a=\"Acme Inc.\", value_b=\"Northwind\") is True\n\ndef test_invented_third_value_is_rejected():\n    # THE test: a value that is neither observed value, nor a normalization\n    # of either, must never pass — regardless of confidence.\n    assert validate(\"ACC-9999\", value_a=\"ACC-1\", value_b=\"ACC-2\") is False\n\ndef test_empty_proposed_value_is_rejected():\n    assert validate(\"\", value_a=\"ACC-1\", value_b=\"ACC-2\") is False\n```\n\n",
